        <mxCell id="c32" value="&lt;b&gt;The (Blank) row&lt;/b&gt; holds the 439 Services lines. Design services do not ship, so the inactive relationship finds no ship date for them, and their revenue lands under (Blank) in the last column only.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Revenue and Shipped Revenue agree in every year, because both use the invoice date. Each year is lower by ship date mainly because Services drop out of it." style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F6F3;strokeColor=#E8F6F3;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="566" y="16" width="278" height="164" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
