        <mxCell id="c38" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Ex 14.2. The year 2027, which the Date table holds and the invoice lines do not, has no row: every measure is blank there. Outlined: the (Blank) row.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="238" width="860" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
